  "limitations": [
    "One top-level pair of manual approval branches with distinct literal messages and failFast true; no branch workspace or result bindings.",
    "Native pending inputs prove overlapping suspension and join. After automated rejection the native sibling cancellation cause is observed without deciding that sibling.",
    "A 30-second observation bound distinguishes missing cancellation; it is not a scheduling or latency guarantee. Automated decisions do not establish human authorization.",
    "No nested parallelism, arbitrary branch work, public support promotion or portable execution. The disposable runtime host and observer remain trusted."
  ]
